"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Saline County runs from 1951 to 2025 across 8 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, and so did June to July. In 2025, August to September came in at 44% of normal and June to July at 150%. Grid 23248 had its driest year in 1956 at 52% of normal.</p>"}
